Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.64,Kick,,0,0,0,,INDIA · EXPLAINED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.64,Title,,0,0,0,,INDIA'S FIRST\NBULLET TRAIN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.64,Foot,,0,0,0,,Source: PTI via Telangana Today · Business Today\NFull video on the channel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}2027 · SURAT TO VAPI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:15.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}India's first bullet train will start running in two thousand twenty seven, between Surat and Vaapi in Gujarat. The rest of the line opens in phases.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:18.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The project was announced in two thousand seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:23.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Delays over land and permissions in Maharashtra, and Covid, pushed it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:31.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}As of September, concrete piers stand along four hundred and fifty six kilometres, and viaduct is built for three hundred and seventy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:40.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}In Maharashtra, a twenty one kilometre tunnel is being dug, including seven kilometres under Thane Creek, the country's first undersea rail tunnel.
